Perl from `Xerl/XML/Element.pm`:

```AUTO
sub starttag {
  my $self = $_[0];
  my ( $name, $temp ) = ( $_[1], undef );

  return $self if $self->get_name() eq $name;
  return undef if ref $self->get_array() ne 'ARRAY';

  for ( @{ $self->get_array() } ) {
    $temp = $_->starttag($name);
    return $temp if defined $temp;
  }

  return undef;
}
```

